pageType: metrics
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: >-
  Purpose of this kickoff: in about thirty minutes, a cross-functional team
  turns a rough idea into a one-page plan everyone can act on. Four steps, one
  owner per decision, and five concrete actions this week. The AI assistant
  drafts, summarizes, and tracks so the humans can decide. Why now: every
  project starts as a guess; this method turns the guess into a plan the team
  owns together.
